        },
        "valueString": "Denies fevers, weight loss, night sweats, rash, eye inflammation, inflammatory back pain, bowel or bladder incontinence, saddle anaesthesia, peripheral paraesthesia, or focal weakness apart from subjective 'wobbly knees'. Denies recent trauma, infection, or systemic symptoms."
      }
